# Tam, the Possibility reduces only "Planeswalker spells you cast": Brain Freeze ({1}{U}) pays its full two mana with Tam
# on the battlefield (an Island and a Mox Emerald), so the pool is empty after the cast (a reduction to {U} would leave
# one mana). Storm counts the spells cast before it this turn - none, since the Moxen and Tam were cast on turn one - so
# Bot2 mills three cards (CR 702.40a). Bot2 also discarded one card down to hand size on turn two.

